OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1943, cellist Anita
OL,14,     FLasker-Wallfisch was sent to the
OL,15,     FAuschwitz-Birkenau concentration
OL,16,     Fcamp. She escaped the gas chambers
OL,17,     Fafter being recruited to an
OL,18,     Forchestra.
